# VeriLens AI — Server-side Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values.
# .env.local is listed in .gitignore — NEVER commit it.
#
# SECURITY RULES:
# ─ Do NOT prefix these keys with VITE_
#   The VITE_ prefix exposes variables to the browser bundle.
# ─ These keys must remain server-side only (api/ directory).
# ─ Never hardcode credentials in source code.
# ─ Never log credential values.
# ─ Rotate keys immediately if accidentally exposed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Hive AI — primary AI/deepfake detector
# Get yours at: https://thehive.ai
HIVE_API_KEY=hNiYI7KemJhLoGFJdbxGDQ==

# Sightengine — secondary AI/deepfake detector
# Get yours at: https://sightengine.com
SIGHTENGINE_API_USER=
SIGHTENGINE_API_SECRET=

# Google Gemini — explanation engine only (never detection)
# Get yours at: https://aistudio.google.com
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Allowed CORS origin (defaults to * if not set)
# Set to your production domain in production, e.g.:
# ALLOWED_ORIGIN=https://verilens.ai
ALLOWED_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
